# Engineering Roadmap

The future development direction is focused on increasing the autonomy and robotics capabilities of the platform.

### Navigation

Autonomous movement and navigation capabilities.

### Mapping

SLAM-based environmental mapping.

### Interaction

Expanded expressive and human–robot interaction capabilities.

### Robotics Middleware

Future integration with **ROS2** to support a broader robotics software ecosystem.

